    match: [["Load regularity", "Parcel proxies (Overture footprints), plan zones, regulation as one layer"], ["Overlay", "Candidate blobs intersected with the regular-property layer"], ["Test rules", "Conforming use? footprint match? tenure evidence? plan violation?"], ["Flag irregular", "Mismatches become true irregular blocks with evidence attached"], ["Publish", "Matched layer feeds the social sensing and ranking stages"]],
